                            	  1211: *
                            	  1212: * *** MVUP *** MVDOWN *** POPA *** PUSHA ***
                            	  1213: *
                            	  1214: * 'MVUP' moves a block up from where A1 points to where A2 points
                            	  1215: * until A1=A3
                            	  1216: *
                            	  1217: * 'MVDOWN' moves a block down from where A1 points to where A3
                            	  1218: * points until A1=A2
                            	  1219: *
                            	  1220: * 'POPA' restores the 'FOR' loop variable save area from the stack
                            	  1221: *
                            	  1222: * 'PUSHA' stacks for 'FOR' loop variable save area onto the stack
                            	  1223: *
01:00001A50 B7C9            	  1224: MVUP	CMP.L	A1,A3		see the above description
01:00001A52 6704            	  1225: 	BEQ	MVRET
